@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #235573
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EAF4F8
title UC13 - Hub Record State Machine (Proposed)\nVõ Tấn Tài - 524H0126

state "Recorded hub" as Recorded
state "Archived hub" as Archived
state "Removed hub" as Removed
state RemovalDecision <<choice>>

[*] -down-> Recorded : createHub [authorized and valid]
Recorded : getHub [authorized] / return details, no mutation
Recorded : updateHub [authorized, valid, current] / record changes
Recorded : removeHub [blocked] / preserve record
Recorded -down-> RemovalDecision : removeHub [authorized, permitted]
RemovalDecision -left-> Archived : [archive policy permits]
RemovalDecision -right-> Removed : [hard-delete policy permits]
Archived -down-> [*]
Removed -down-> [*]

note right of Recorded
  The policy branches are alternatives, not
  confirmed implementation behaviour.
  Delete versus archive, dependencies and
  operation permissions are To Confirm.
end note
note bottom of RemovalDecision
  Read leaves the record unchanged. Invalid,
  conflicting or failed writes also preserve
  the prior record (error paths in UC13).
  Capacity units and limits are To Confirm.
end note
footer AI-assisted draft; student review required before submission
@enduml
